{
  "$description": "Lolly starter tokens — deliberately small: one brand colour over a quiet neutral base, and nothing else. A new brand grows by ADDING colours in the #/start Design System studio, not by clearing out a big preset palette. Layered DTCG: a shared 'base' set of two ramps (primary + neutral) with per-theme semantic slots that alias into them. Every $value is a CSS oklch() string (L%, chroma, hue); anything needing hex goes through the engine's colorToHex. Add a secondary, a chart spectrum, and more as you go — or replace the lot via the #/start wizard or 'npm run ingest:brand'.",
  "$metadata": {
    "tokenSetOrder": [
      "base",
      "light",
      "dark"
    ]
  },
